{"seq":4,"slug":"running-in-production","title":"Running In Production","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-service-engineering/running-in-production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graceful-shutdown","title":"优雅关闭","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-service-engineering/running-in-production/graceful-shutdown","wordCount":1920,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-hooks","title":"可观测性接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-service-engineering/running-in-production/observability-hooks","wordCount":1990,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"middleware-patterns","title":"中间件模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-service-engineering/running-in-production/middleware-patterns","wordCount":1896,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲生产运行：捕获 SIGTERM、用 srv.Shutdown 停止接收新请求并等手头完成、按从外到内顺序关闭的优雅关闭；接入日志/指标/追踪三支柱与健康探针的可观测性；以及用中间件统一处理日志、认证、恢复、指标、限流等横切关注点（收束本 hub 诸多主题）。</p>\n"}